 ],
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Theo's shadow had come",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.003,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "back\u2026 with a warning.",
   "start": 2.003,
   "end": 3.628,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "They lied. It's not",
   "start": 3.928,
   "end": 5.731,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "a sunrise.",
   "start": 5.731,
   "end": 6.68,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "It couldn't speak. So",
   "start": 7.58,
   "end": 9.326,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "it drew.",
   "start": 9.326,
   "end": 9.991,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "A black sun?",
   "start": 11.591,
   "end": 12.615,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "When the black sun",
   "start": 13.015,
   "end": 14.326,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "rises\u2026 the shadows never",
   "start": 14.326,
   "end": 16.073,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "have to go back.",
   "start": 16.073,
   "end": 17.239,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And everyone in town\u2026",
   "start": 17.639,
   "end": 19.456,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "fades. Forever.",
   "start": 19.456,
   "end": 20.753,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Tonight?",
   "start": 21.953,
   "end": 22.849,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mom! You have to",
   "start": 24.349,
   "end": 25.414,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "see this!",
   "start": 25.414,
   "end": 26.013,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo, it's just a",
   "start": 26.413,
   "end": 27.482,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "drawing. Go to sleep.",
   "start": 27.482,
   "end": 28.803,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "But behind her\u2026 her",
   "start": 29.303,
   "end": 30.731,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "shadow turned its head.",
   "start": 30.731,
   "end": 32.46,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And slowly\u2026 it smiled.",
   "start": 32.96,
   "end": 35.328,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "At nine o'clock, the",
   "start": 36.828,
   "end": 38.586,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "tower struck.",
   "start": 38.586,
   "end": 39.729,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And something black rose",
   "start": 40.329,
   "end": 42.218,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "over the old factory.",
   "start": 42.218,
   "end": 43.871,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The street lights died.",
   "start": 45.828,
   "end": 47.906,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "One by one.",
   "start": 47.906,
   "end": 48.9,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo\u2026 I can't feel",
   "start": 49.3,
   "end": 50.566,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "my hands.",
   "start": 50.566,
   "end": 51.199,
   "spk": "MO"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hold on, Mom!",
   "start": 51.499,
   "end": 52.885,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "Every lamp in this",
   "start": 54.828,
   "end": 55.842,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "town is wired to",
   "start": 55.842,
   "end": 56.743,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "the clock tower.",
   "start": 56.743,
   "end": 57.644,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "If they all turn",
   "start": 57.944,
   "end": 58.847,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "on at once\u2026 the",
   "start": 58.847,
   "end": 59.693,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "shadows have nowhere to",
   "start": 59.693,
   "end": 60.99,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "hide!",
   "start": 60.99,
   "end": 61.272,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "Going somewhere, Theo?",
   "start": 62.928,
   "end": 64.498,
   "spk": "F"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo's shadow jumped at",
   "start": 64.898,
   "end": 66.903,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the Foreman.",
   "start": 66.903,
   "end": 67.949,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now!",
   "start": 68.249,
   "end": 68.953,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo pulled the lever.",
   "start": 71.828,
   "end": 73.983,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And for one second\u2026",
   "start": 74.483,
   "end": 75.889,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "the whole town turned",
   "start": 75.889,
   "end": 77.443,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "to light.",
   "start": 77.443,
   "end": 78.109,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "The black sun cracked.",
   "start": 79.409,
   "end": 80.966,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "And every shadow\u2026 was",
   "start": 80.966,
   "end": 82.452,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "pulled back home.",
   "start": 82.452,
   "end": 83.655,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "Mom could feel her",
   "start": 86.409,
   "end": 88.099,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "hands again.",
   "start": 88.099,
   "end": 89.225,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "We did it\u2026",
   "start": 89.625,
   "end": 90.585,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "Theo looked down. He",
   "start": 91.085,
   "end": 92.737,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "had a shadow again.",
   "start": 92.737,
   "end": 94.307,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "You're back!",
   "start": 94.707,
   "end": 95.496,
   "spk": "T"
  },
  {
   "text": "But Theo's shadow\u2026 was",
   "start": 98.709,
   "end": 100.587,
   "spk": "N"
  },
  {
   "text": "wearing a top hat.",
   "start": 100.587,
   "end": 102.123,
   "spk": "N"
  }
 ],
